 fw=['On the second night '+link(4,'Brahmacāriṇī')+' won Śiva by penance. Tonight comes the wedding, and with it a new form: <b>Candraghaṇṭā</b>, the Goddess with a half-moon shaped like a bell (<i>ghaṇṭā</i>) on her brow.','After two calm nights she is the first warrior among the nine: golden, ten-armed, riding a tiger, ready for battle yet gracious to her devotees.'],
